From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: herdr maintainers <maintainers@herdr.dev>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] default lib-vt panes to grapheme clustering

Herdr renders libghostty-vt cells directly and requires DEC mode 2027 to
store multi-codepoint grapheme clusters in one terminal cell. Set it in the
terminal's default modes so RIS restores clustering instead of disabling it.

Herdr issue: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr/issues/243
Vendored base: 7aab0a0392369613472bd5dcfd66bef58e78c3ec
---
diff --git a/crates/gterminal/vendor/libghostty-vt/src/terminal/c/terminal.zig b/crates/gterminal/vendor/libghostty-vt/src/terminal/c/terminal.zig
index 736d0ca084..47a5c8499e 100644
--- a/crates/gterminal/vendor/libghostty-vt/src/terminal/c/terminal.zig
+++ b/crates/gterminal/vendor/libghostty-vt/src/terminal/c/terminal.zig
@@ -834,6 +834,7 @@ fn new_(
         .{
             .cols = cols,
             .rows = rows,
+            .default_modes = .{ .grapheme_cluster = true },
         },
     );
     errdefer t.deinit(alloc);
